<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('partials/head') %><title>Tritech Hub</title>
<style>
.hero{min-height:100vh;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--dark-green) 0%,var(--light-green) 100%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;color:#fff;padding:40px 20px;}
.hero-box{max-width:600px;}
.hero h1{font-size:48px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px;}
.hero p{font-size:18px;opacity:.9;margin-bottom:40px;}
.hero-btns{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.btn-white{background:#fff;color:var(--dark-green);padding:14px 32px;border-radius:30px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;}
.btn-white:hover{background:#f0fdf0;}
.portals{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.portal-pill{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);color:#fff;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:20px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;}
.portal-pill:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);}
.logo-icon{font-size:60px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;padding:60px 40px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;}
.feature{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);text-align:center;}
.feature i{font-size:28px;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:12px;}
.feature h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;}
.feature p{font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);}
@media(max-width:768px){.features{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:40px 20px;}.hero h1{font-size:32px;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-box">
    <div class="logo-icon">📱</div>
    <h1>Tritech Hub</h1>
    <p>iPhone Installment Management System<br>Buy Now, Pay in Ghana Cedis</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
      <a href="/auth/login" class="btn-white btn">Get Started</a>
    </div>
    <div class="portals">
      <a href="/auth/login" class="portal-pill"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Admin Portal</a>
      <a href="/auth/login" class="portal-pill"><i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i> Staff Portal</a>
      <a href="/auth/login" class="portal-pill"><i class="fas fa-user"></i> Customer Portal</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="features">
  <div class="feature"><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i><h3>iPhone Installments</h3><p>Buy the latest iPhones and pay in daily, weekly, or monthly installments over 6 months.</p></div>
  <div class="feature"><i class="fas fa-lock"></i><h3>Automatic Device Lock</h3><p>Devices automatically lock after 48 hours grace period via SimpleMDM integration.</p></div>
  <div class="feature"><i class="fas fa-credit-card"></i><h3>Paystack Payments</h3><p>Pay securely via MTN MoMo, Vodafone Cash, AirtelTigo or credit/debit card.</p></div>
  <div class="feature"><i class="fas fa-users"></i><h3>Multi-Tenant SaaS</h3><p>Each business gets their own subdomain and isolated data environment.</p></div>
  <div class="feature"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar"></i><h3>Reports & Analytics</h3><p>Daily, weekly and monthly reports with full transaction history and analytics.</p></div>
  <div class="feature"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i><h3>Ghana Regions</h3><p>Full support for all 16 Ghana regions and districts for customer registration.</p></div>
</div>
</body></html>
